WEBVTT

00:09:58.636 --> 00:10:01.138
you've seen these guys
walking around town, right?

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:04.642
There's an Instagram page about it
called the Midtown Uniform.

00:10:04.683 --> 00:10:06.143
There's no dress code,

00:10:06.143 --> 00:10:09.146
but everyone's wearing
exactly the same thing

00:10:09.146 --> 00:10:11.774
out of fear of looking like someone

00:10:11.774 --> 00:10:14.652
who doesn't know
what is or is not appropriate.

00:10:15.653 --> 00:10:17.363
So, you know,

00:10:17.363 --> 00:10:21.617
trying to pretend that we don't care
about what people wear

00:10:21.617 --> 00:10:25.371
when we so obviously do isn't the answer.

00:10:25.412 --> 00:10:28.707
And let's face it,
sometimes it makes sense

00:10:28.749 --> 00:10:31.085
to draw conclusions
from what people are wearing.